{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FkNwKTujv9Ke6ZLZjwhdL3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experiment results for all \"planned\" experiments in the experiment plan, under the \"best\" tier definition. Let me carefully go through each planned experiment and create realistic, detailed predictions that align with the best-case scenario where all three claims hold.\n\nLet me review the best tier definition:\n- 全量数据泛化成功 + 跨agent迁移有效 + 人工标注验证通过\n- All three claims fully supported, original framing needs no adjustment\n\nKey metric ranges for best tier:\n- probe_fulldata_macro_f1: [0.85, 0.91]\n\n\n- gap_vs_repeat3_fulldata_pp: [5.0, 8.0]\n- gap_vs_lf_oracle_pp: [3.0, 7.0]\n- cross_agent_macro_f1: [0.78, 0.88]\n- human_gold_probe_f1: [0.82, 0.9]\n- human_label_accuracy_pct: [80, 90]\n- meanpool_lr_macro_f1: [0.72, 0.8]\n- llm_judge_f1: [0.82, 0.9]\n- llm_judge_cost\n\nNow I'm laying out the expected metric ranges for the best-case scenario across all the key performance indicators, including the cross-agent transfer effectiveness, human validation metrics, and the various model performance benchmarks.\n\nLooking at the planned experiments: I'll train the probe on full data with high confidence, expecting F1 to stay around 0.85-0.91, then compare it against the LF oracle baseline where the probe should outperform by 3-7 percentage points. I'm also setting up comparisons with an LLM judge baseline, a mean-pooling with logistic regression approach, and planning cross-agent evaluation plus ablation studies on window size, along with qualitative error analysis.\n\nFor the full data experiment, the 39,408 high-confidence windows should provide enough signal that noise doesn't significantly degrade performance, so I'm predicting F1 around 0.87.\n\nThe gap between my probe and the repeat baseline should be roughly 6.5 percentage points. For the LF oracle baseline, my probe should outperform it by about 4-5 percentage points on the full dataset. The LLM judge baseline performs around 0.83-0.87 depending on whether it's zero-shot or few-shot, but at a much higher computational cost. The mean pooling with logistic regression baseline is weaker at around 0.76 F1.\n\nFor the cross-agent evaluation, I'm getting around 0.83 F1, and looking at the human annotation results—the label accuracy is about 85%, my probe achieves 0.86 F1 on the gold labels, and the inter-annotator agreement measured by Fleiss' kappa is around 0.72. Now I'm ready to compile these results into the YAML output.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10561,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10561},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f4d3c48-dae2-4ad7-bc6c-79545c647f2e","uuid":"d49752f9-ad97-44f9-868f-12c77c982bd7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FkNwKTujv9Ke6ZLZjwhdL3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立。Headline: 弱监督框架成功迁移到agent trajectory领域，\n  GRU probe在全量噪声标签上学到了超越启发式规则的时序progress信号，\n  且跨实现可迁移。三条claims各有独立实验支撑，无需调整强度。\n  Paper结构：弱监督框架（方法论贡献）+ 时序建模实证（技术贡献）+ 跨agent泛化（泛化性贡献），\n  强调Snorkel到sequential trajectory的非平凡迁移 + 实用性（<5ms inference）。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"全量数据泛化训练\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"conf≥1全量54,809窗口训练GRU probe，与conf≥2子集训练对比，验证标签噪声容忍度\"\n    expected_results:\n      fulldata_macro_f1: 0.8742\n      fulldata_accuracy: 0.9031\n      fulldata_f1_stagnation: 0.8189\n      fulldata_f1_progress: 0.9295\n      fulldata_precision_macro: 0.8853\n      fulldata_recall_macro: 0.8648\n      conf2_macro_f1_reference: 0.9055\n      delta_vs_conf2_pp: -3.13\n      gap_vs_repeat3_fulldata_pp: 6.52\n      best_epoch: 5\n      total_epochs: 10\n      val_macro_f1_best: 0.8891\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf=1窗口占总量72%（39,408/54,809），这些窗口仅有单个LF投票，标签噪声率约25-30%。\n      在best档位下，GRU的时序建模能力足以从噪声标签中提取一致的progress信号——\n      因为多数conf=1窗口的噪声是随机的而非系统性的，GRU通过序列内一致性约束实现了隐式去噪。\n      F1从0.9055下降至0.8742（-3.13pp）是合理的：噪声增加但训练数据量增加3.6x提供了补偿。\n      关键是gap vs Repeat-3仍保持6.52pp，证明probe在噪声条件下仍显著优于最强启发式。\n      训练需要更多epoch（5 vs 3）才能收敛，因为模型需要更多迭代来拟合噪声分布。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Full-data vs High-confidence Training\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Train Size\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"F1-Prog\", \"Δ vs Repeat-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"conf≥2 (MVP)\", \"15,401\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"0.9518\", \"+6.24pp\"]\n          - [\"conf≥1 (full)\", \"54,809\", \"0.8742\", \"0.8189\", \"0.9295\", \"+6.52pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"—\", \"0.8190\", \"0.7512\", \"0.8868\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curves对比图：conf≥2在epoch 3即收敛，conf≥1在epoch 5收敛但最终validation loss更低，说明大数据量最终弥补了噪声劣势\"\n      - \"Per-confidence-level F1分解：conf=1/2/3测试窗口上的F1分别为0.83/0.91/0.96，展示模型在高置信窗口上表现更好但低置信窗口也可用\"\n    analysis: >\n      F1仅下降3.13pp证明核心假设成立：conf=1噪声标签不显著损害probe学习能力。\n      Stagnation类F1下降更大（-4.04pp vs progress类-2.23pp），因为stagnation窗口在conf=1中噪声更高\n      （单个LF投stagnation时更易出错），但仍保持>0.81的可用水平。\n      Gap vs Repeat-3在全量数据上反而略增（6.52 vs 6.24pp），因为Repeat-3在conf=1窗口上\n      表现更差——这些窗口包含更多语义多样的停滞模式，正是Repeat-3无法捕获的。\n\n  - name: \"LF Ensemble Oracle Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接用3个LF的实时输出做窗口级判定（majority vote），作为probe的上界参照\"\n    expected_results:\n      lf_oracle_macro_f1_conf2: 0.8612\n      lf_oracle_macro_f1_fulldata: 0.8203\n      lf_oracle_f1_stagnation_conf2: 0.7985\n      lf_oracle_f1_progress_conf2: 0.9239\n      lf_oracle_f1_stagnation_fulldata: 0.7341\n      lf_oracle_f1_progress_fulldata: 0.9065\n      gap_probe_vs_oracle_conf2_pp: 4.43\n      gap_probe_vs_oracle_fulldata_pp: 5.39\n      lf_oracle_coverage: 0.719\n      abstain_rate: 0.281\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle直接使用LF投票结果，在conf≥2数据上表现较好因为这些窗口本身就是LF高一致的子集。\n      但oracle有两个固有局限：(1) 它只能在有LF投票的窗口上做判定，覆盖率仅71.9%；\n      (2) 它无法捕获LF规则之外的信号——比如action语义漂移、上下文依赖的progress模式。\n      Probe在conf≥2上超oracle 4.43pp，在全量数据上超5.39pp，差距扩大因为conf=1窗口中\n      LF之间分歧大，oracle的majority vote退化为单LF判定。这证明GRU学到了超越LF启发式的信号。\n      stagnation类上差距更大（probe 0.8593 vs oracle 0.7985 = +6.08pp），\n      因为stagnation的语义多样性恰好是规则方法的盲区。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: Probe vs LF Oracle vs Baselines\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1 (conf≥2)\", \"Macro-F1 (full)\", \"Coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8742\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle (majority)\", \"0.8612\", \"0.8203\", \"71.9%\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.8432\", \"0.8190\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Cosine Similarity\", \"0.3129\", \"—\", \"100%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram：probe正确但oracle错误的样本 vs oracle正确但probe错误的样本，展示probe捕获了oracle遗漏的模式类型\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe vs LF oracle的差距（4.43-5.39pp）直接论证了Claim 1的核心：\n      probe不只是在学LF的规则，而是从LF提供的弱监督信号出发，通过时序建模学到了更丰富的表示。\n      Oracle在stagnation检测上尤其弱——LF设计时各自关注不同的stagnation信号\n      （file_diff_delta关注输出变化、command_repetition关注行为重复、outcome_backpropagation关注结果），\n      它们的简单投票无法捕获多维度信号的交互。GRU通过序列建模隐式实现了这种信号融合。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-Judge Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude Sonnet 4 + GPT-4o zero-shot/few-shot窗口级progress判定，对比probe的cost-accuracy tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.8347\n      claude_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.8681\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.8192\n      gpt4o_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.8534\n      claude_fewshot_f1_stagnation: 0.8103\n      claude_fewshot_f1_progress: 0.9259\n      probe_macro_f1_reference: 0.9055\n      gap_probe_vs_best_llm_pp: 3.74\n      claude_avg_tokens_per_window: 4280\n      claude_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 12.84\n      probe_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 0.41\n      llm_judge_cost_multiplier: 31.3\n      claude_latency_per_window_ms: 2850\n      probe_latency_per_window_ms: 4.7\n      latency_multiplier: 606\n      eval_sample_size: 500\n      inter_run_variance_claude: 0.018\n      inter_run_variance_probe: 0.003\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-as-judge在best档位下表现良好但不及probe，原因有三：\n      (1) Window-level判定需要理解5-step序列的整体progress趋势，LLM倾向逐step评估再聚合，\n      丢失stagnation onset的时序签名——与Mean-pooling的failure mode类似；\n      (2) Zero-shot时LLM缺少domain-specific的progress/stagnation calibration，\n      few-shot通过示例部分弥补（+3.34pp for Claude），但仍不如从15K样本中学习的probe；\n      (3) LLM在stagnation检测上特别保守——倾向将\"有动作执行\"判为progress，\n      即使这些动作集体无效。Claude优于GPT-4o因为对code/agent行为的理解更强。\n      Cost multiplier 31.3x来自：每窗口平均4,280 tokens（5 steps × 800+ tokens/step + prompt），\n      以Sonnet 4价格计算。Probe推理仅需前向传播1024×5维输入，成本几乎可忽略。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Probe vs LLM-as-Judge\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"Cost/1K\", \"Latency/window\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"$0.41\", \"4.7ms\"]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet 4 (few-shot)\", \"0.8681\", \"0.8103\", \"$12.84\", \"2.85s\"]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet 4 (zero-shot)\", \"0.8347\", \"0.7756\", \"$11.20\", \"2.41s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o (few-shot)\", \"0.8534\", \"0.7948\", \"$9.63\", \"3.12s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o (zero-shot)\", \"0.8192\", \"0.7589\", \"$8.47\", \"2.78s\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-Accuracy Pareto图：x轴=cost per 1K windows (log scale)，y轴=Macro-F1。Probe位于Pareto前沿左上角，LLM-as-judge位于右侧。标注cost multiplier和F1 gap\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix对比：Probe vs Claude few-shot，highlight probe在semantic stagnation上的优势\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-as-judge在F1上可用（0.87）但不及probe（0.91），且成本高31x、延迟高606x。\n      这直接回应reviewer的\"为什么不直接用LLM\"质疑：即使忽略成本，probe在准确率上也更优，\n      因为它从大量弱监督样本中学到了domain-calibrated的progress判定边界。\n      LLM的优势场景是冷启动（无训练数据时），但一旦有LF框架提供弱监督标签，\n      专用probe在accuracy和efficiency上双重胜出。这构成了清晰的cost-accuracy Pareto论证。\n\n  - name: \"Mean-pooling + Logistic Regression Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"窗口内step embeddings均值池化 + LR分类，作为非时序建模的参数匹配下界\"\n    expected_results:\n      meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.7683\n      meanpool_lr_accuracy: 0.8104\n      meanpool_lr_f1_stagnation: 0.6571\n      meanpool_lr_f1_progress: 0.8795\n      meanpool_lr_precision_macro: 0.7892\n      meanpool_lr_recall_macro: 0.7543\n      gap_gru_vs_meanpool_pp: 13.72\n      meanpool_lr_best_C: 0.1\n      meanpool_svm_macro_f1: 0.7821\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mean-pooling将5个step embeddings平均为单个1024维向量，完全丢弃了步骤间的时序信息。\n      在best档位下F1=0.7683，比GRU低13.72pp，差距显著。\n      根本原因：stagnation的核心时序特征是\"从有效到无效的转折点\"——\n      比如前2步有进展但后3步停滞，mean-pooling会将这种模式平均成\"中等进展\"，\n      而GRU通过门控机制精确定位transition point。\n      Stagnation类F1尤其低（0.6571 vs GRU的0.8593），因为stagnation窗口中\n      往往混有个别看似有效的step（如运行了新命令但结果无用），均值化后这些step\n      稀释了stagnation信号。Progress类相对好（0.8795）因为progress窗口中steps通常一致向前。\n      SVM略优于LR（+1.38pp）因为非线性核捕获了部分embedding空间中的非线性边界，\n      但仍远不如GRU，说明瓶颈在时序建模而非分类器容量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Temporal vs Static Aggregation\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Aggregation\", \"Classifier\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"Δ vs GRU\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"Sequential (learned)\", \"GRU+Attention\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"Mean\", \"Logistic Regression\", \"0.7683\", \"0.6571\", \"-13.72pp\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + SVM\", \"Mean\", \"RBF-SVM\", \"0.7821\", \"0.6743\", \"-12.34pp\"]\n          - [\"Max-pool + LR\", \"Max\", \"Logistic Regression\", \"0.7412\", \"0.6298\", \"-16.43pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"Rule-based\", \"Heuristic\", \"0.8432\", \"0.7512\", \"-6.24pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 各聚合策略的Macro-F1对比，清晰展示时序建模（GRU）相对于静态聚合（mean/max-pool）的增量价值\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mean-pool+LR的0.7683 F1确认了时序建模的必要性——GRU的+13.72pp增益不是来自更大的模型容量\n      （LR在1024维上已有充分表达力），而是来自序列内步骤间依赖关系的建模。\n      有趣的是Repeat-3（0.8432）反而优于Mean-pool+LR（0.7683），因为Repeat-3至少捕获了\n      一种时序模式（连续重复），而mean-pooling连这种简单模式也丢失了。\n      这为Claim 2提供了强支撑：时序建模是关键，不仅仅是更好的特征。\n\n  - name: \"Probe错误分析\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"在conf≥2测试集上对probe的FP/FN按action type、LF source、trajectory outcome分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_test_errors: 221\n      false_positives: 98\n      false_negatives: 123\n      fp_rate: 0.0412\n      fn_rate: 0.0636\n      fp_dominant_pattern: \"exploratory_actions_misclassified_as_stagnation\"\n      fn_dominant_pattern: \"semantic_drift_with_diverse_commands\"\n      fp_by_action_type:\n        file_editing: 0.31\n        command_execution: 0.42\n        search_exploration: 0.27\n      fn_by_action_type:\n        file_editing: 0.24\n        command_execution: 0.35\n        mixed_diverse: 0.41\n      fp_trajectory_outcome_resolved_pct: 0.67\n      fn_trajectory_outcome_unresolved_pct: 0.82\n      errors_where_repeat3_correct: 34\n      errors_where_probe_uniquely_correct: 187\n    result_rationale: >\n      在best档位下probe的错误总量较少（221/3,080 ≈ 7.2%），且错误分布揭示了有意义的模式。\n      FP（将progress误判为stagnation）集中在探索性行为——agent在搜索文件、阅读文档、\n      尝试不同方法时，表面上看起来\"没有进展\"但实际在积累信息。这是probe的合理failure mode：\n      information gathering确实与stagnation在embedding空间中相似（都表现为\"无输出变化\"）。\n      FN（将stagnation误判为progress）集中在语义漂移场景——agent执行多样化但集体无效的命令，\n      每一步看起来都不同，embedding变化大但方向无效。这正是probe最难的case，也是future work方向。\n      67%的FP发生在最终resolved的轨迹中——probe对\"暂时绕路但最终成功\"的轨迹过于悲观。\n      Probe相比Repeat-3额外捕获了187个正确case，仅在34个case上不如Repeat-3——净增值清晰。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Error Analysis by Pattern Type\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"Count\", \"Dominant Pattern\", \"Example\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP (progress→stagnation)\", \"98\", \"Exploratory search without file changes\", \"Agent reads 4 files, runs grep, no edits yet\"]\n          - [\"FN (stagnation→progress)\", \"123\", \"Diverse but ineffective commands\", \"Agent tries 5 different fix approaches, all fail\"]\n      - name: \"Table 8: Probe vs Repeat-3 Error Overlap\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"Count\", \"Pct of Total Errors\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Both wrong\", \"87\", \"39.4%\"]\n          - [\"Probe wrong, Repeat-3 correct\", \"34\", \"15.4%\"]\n          - [\"Probe correct, Repeat-3 wrong\", \"187\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Both correct\", \"2,772\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Error case gallery：4个代表性FP和4个代表性FN的窗口摘要，标注action sequence和LF votes，帮助reviewer理解probe的failure mode\"\n      - \"Scatter plot：x=窗口内embedding变化量，y=probe预测概率，颜色=真实标签，标注FP/FN cluster位置\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析服务于两个论文目标：(1) 展示probe捕获了Repeat-3遗漏的187个case——这些是\n      语义多样的停滞模式（如agent用不同方法反复失败但Repeat-3只检测字面重复）；\n      (2) 识别probe的系统性failure mode（exploratory behavior vs stagnation的区分），\n      为future work提供方向（引入trajectory outcome信号或多粒度建模）。\n      FP中67%在resolved轨迹中这一发现特别有价值——可以在Discussion中讨论\n      \"progress\"概念的粒度：window-level停滞不等于trajectory-level失败。\n\n  - name: \"跨Agent迁移评估\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent训练的probe在OpenHands轨迹上zero-shot评估，验证progress信号的跨实现迁移性\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_windows: 48352\n      openhands_stagnation_windows: 18914\n      openhands_progress_windows: 29438\n      cross_agent_macro_f1: 0.8347\n      cross_agent_accuracy: 0.8621\n      cross_agent_f1_stagnation: 0.7823\n      cross_agent_f1_progress: 0.8871\n      cross_agent_precision_macro: 0.8456\n      cross_agent_recall_macro: 0.8264\n      within_agent_reference_f1: 0.9055\n      delta_cross_vs_within_pp: -7.08\n      repeat3_on_openhands_f1: 0.7894\n      gap_vs_repeat3_cross_pp: 4.53\n      lf_adaptation_notes: \"command_repetition LF需适配OpenHands的action格式差异\"\n      openhands_embed_time_hours: 6.2\n      openhands_unique_instances: 2195\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨agent迁移F1=0.8347，比within-agent低7.08pp但仍在best档可用范围[0.78, 0.88]内。\n      下降来自三个因素：(1) OpenHands的action格式与SWE-agent不同——OpenHands使用\n      structured action space（CmdRunAction, FileEditAction等），而SWE-agent使用\n      free-form bash commands，embedding空间有分布偏移；(2) OpenHands的停滞模式不同——\n      它有专门的think action和structured editing，某些SWE-agent中的\"无效重复\"在OpenHands中\n      不存在，但OpenHands有自己独特的停滞模式（如反复调用FileEditAction但diff为空）；\n      (3) LF适配引入了少量noise——command_repetition LF需要重写以匹配OpenHands格式。\n      尽管如此，0.8347仍显著优于Repeat-3在OpenHands上的表现（0.7894, +4.53pp），\n      证明probe学到的不是SWE-agent特有的行为模式，而是更通用的progress信号——\n      embedding空间中的\"步骤间语义变化模式\"在不同agent实现间部分共享。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Cross-Agent Transfer Results\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Agent\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"F1-Prog\", \"Δ vs Repeat-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Within-agent\", \"SWE-agent\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"0.9518\", \"+6.24pp\"]\n          - [\"Cross-agent (zero-shot)\", \"OpenHands\", \"0.8347\", \"0.7823\", \"0.8871\", \"+4.53pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"OpenHands\", \"0.7894\", \"0.7156\", \"0.8632\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"OpenHands\", \"0.7981\", \"0.7234\", \"0.8728\", \"+0.87pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE可视化：SWE-agent和OpenHands的GRU hidden states在同一空间中的分布，颜色标注agent来源和progress/stagnation标签，展示跨agent的表示空间重叠程度\"\n      - \"Per-instance difficulty scatter：x=SWE-bench instance difficulty (resolved rate)，y=cross-agent probe F1，验证迁移效果是否与任务难度相关\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨agent迁移的成功直接支撑Claim 3：probe学到的是通用的goal-directed progress信号。\n      7.08pp的下降主要来自distribution shift而非信号本质差异——t-SNE可视化会展示\n      两个agent的hidden states在progress/stagnation维度上有清晰重叠，但在agent-specific\n      行为模式维度上有偏移。Gap vs Repeat-3从6.24pp降至4.53pp但仍显著，\n      说明时序建模的增量价值在跨agent场景下依然存在。\n      LF Oracle在OpenHands上仅比Repeat-3好0.87pp，因为LF规则是为SWE-agent设计的，\n      适配后覆盖率和精度都下降——而probe通过embedding空间的泛化能力部分弥补了这个gap。\n\n  - name: \"Window Size消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"k=3,5,7的窗口大小消融，评估检测粒度与信号积累的tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_macro_f1: 0.8724\n      k5_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      k7_macro_f1: 0.9148\n      k3_f1_stagnation: 0.8142\n      k5_f1_stagnation: 0.8593\n      k7_f1_stagnation: 0.8712\n      k3_detection_latency_steps: 3\n      k5_detection_latency_steps: 5\n      k7_detection_latency_steps: 7\n      k3_total_windows: 72841\n      k5_total_windows: 54809\n      k7_total_windows: 43267\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=7比k=5略优（+0.93pp），因为更长的窗口积累了更多时序context——\n      特别是stagnation onset通常需要3-4步来确认（前几步可能是合理的探索），\n      k=7提供了足够的上下文来区分\"暂时探索\"和\"真正停滞\"。\n      k=3较差（-3.31pp），因为3步窗口中有效信号太少——很多stagnation在3步内\n      看起来与exploration无异。但k=3的优势是检测延迟最低（3步 vs 7步），\n      在实际部署中有latency-accuracy tradeoff。\n      k=5是sweet spot：F1接近k=7但检测延迟少2步，且与LF设计一致（LF也基于5步窗口设计），\n      减少了LF-probe之间的粒度不匹配。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A1: Window Size Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Window k\", \"# Windows\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"Detection Latency\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"k=3\", \"72,841\", \"0.8724\", \"0.8142\", \"3 steps\"]\n          - [\"k=5 (default)\", \"54,809\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"5 steps\"]\n          - [\"k=7\", \"43,267\", \"0.9148\", \"0.8712\", \"7 steps\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line chart: window size vs F1 和 detection latency 的dual-axis图，展示accuracy-latency tradeoff曲线\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=5的选择是合理的——k=7仅增加0.93pp但延迟增加2步、数据量减少21%。\n      在paper中可以用k=7结果作为\"oracle window size\"参考，说明更多context确实有帮助，\n      但k=5在实用性和准确率之间取得了最佳平衡。\n\n  - name: \"架构消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer encoder vs MLP on pooled\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attention_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      gru_meanpool_macro_f1: 0.8891\n      transformer_encoder_macro_f1: 0.8967\n      mlp_pooled_macro_f1: 0.7812\n      gru_attention_params: 1.32e6\n      gru_meanpool_params: 1.31e6\n      transformer_encoder_params: 2.67e6\n      mlp_pooled_params: 0.53e6\n      gru_attention_train_time_min: 12\n      transformer_encoder_train_time_min: 28\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU+attention最优但Transformer encoder仅差0.88pp——在best档位下两种时序架构都有效，\n      差距不大。GRU+attention的优势来自attention机制对stagnation onset位置的显式建模——\n      attention权重可以聚焦在序列中\"转折\"的step上，而GRU+mean-pool丢失了这种位置敏感性。\n      Transformer encoder参数量2x于GRU但F1略低，因为5步的序列太短，\n      self-attention的全局依赖建模优势无法体现，反而过参数化导致轻微过拟合。\n      MLP on pooled（0.7812）与Mean-pool+LR（0.7683）接近，确认了瓶颈在时序建模而非分类器。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A2: Architecture Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"Params\", \"Train Time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + Attention\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"1.32M\", \"12 min\"]\n          - [\"Transformer Encoder (2L)\", \"0.8967\", \"0.8478\", \"2.67M\", \"28 min\"]\n          - [\"GRU + Mean-pool\", \"0.8891\", \"0.8389\", \"1.31M\", \"11 min\"]\n          - [\"MLP on Concat\", \"0.7812\", \"0.6689\", \"0.53M\", \"5 min\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Attention weight heatmap：在stagnation窗口中attention集中在onset step（通常step 2-3），在progress窗口中attention分布更均匀\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构消融的核心结论：时序建模是关键（GRU/Transformer >> MLP/pooling），\n      但具体架构选择影响不大（GRU vs Transformer差异<1pp）。\n      这支持paper的framing——架构是deliberate simple choice，贡献在方法论而非架构创新。\n      Attention的可解释性是bonus：它自然揭示了stagnation onset的位置。\n\n  - name: \"LF Hold-one-out消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个LF重新训练probe，量化各LF的边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_3lf_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      drop_file_diff_delta_f1: 0.8634\n      drop_command_repetition_f1: 0.8812\n      drop_outcome_backprop_f1: 0.8903\n      marginal_file_diff_delta_pp: 4.21\n      marginal_command_repetition_pp: 2.43\n      marginal_outcome_backprop_pp: 1.52\n      two_lf_coverage_drop_pct:\n        without_file_diff: 0.583\n        without_cmd_rep: 0.641\n        without_outcome: 0.695\n    result_rationale: >\n      file_diff_delta贡献最大（-4.21pp when removed），因为它是唯一直接测量\"输出变化\"的LF——\n      在agent trajectory中，文件变化是最强的progress信号，移除它导致大量progress窗口失去关键标注依据。\n      command_repetition贡献中等（-2.43pp），它捕获的是stagnation中最常见的子模式（行为重复），\n      但部分信号与Repeat-3 baseline重叠。\n      outcome_backpropagation贡献最小（-1.52pp），因为它是事后信号（基于最终结果回溯），\n      在训练时提供的增量信息最少——很多窗口在它投票前已被其他两个LF覆盖。\n      但三个LF的组合效应是非加和的：移除任一个都导致覆盖率下降（从71.9%降至58-70%），\n      这意味着每个LF覆盖了不同子集的窗口，它们的互补性是框架价值的核心。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A3: LF Hold-one-out Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"LF Configuration\", \"# LFs\", \"Coverage\", \"Probe F1\", \"Δ vs Full\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"All 3 LFs\", \"3\", \"71.9%\", \"0.9055\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"− file_diff_delta\", \"2\", \"58.3%\", \"0.8634\", \"-4.21pp\"]\n          - [\"− command_repetition\", \"2\", \"64.1%\", \"0.8812\", \"-2.43pp\"]\n          - [\"− outcome_backprop\", \"2\", \"69.5%\", \"0.8903\", \"-1.52pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart：每个LF在不同conf级别上的投票覆盖率，展示LF间的互补性\"\n    analysis: >\n      三个LF都有不可替代的贡献，但重要性递减（file_diff > cmd_rep > outcome_backprop）。\n      这个结果for paper的意义：(1) 证明LF框架设计是合理的——每个LF捕获了不同维度的信号；\n      (2) 提示未来工作可以设计更多LF来进一步提升覆盖率和准确率；\n      (3) file_diff_delta的主导地位与直觉一致——在SWE任务中，代码变化是最直接的progress指标。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon辅助损失消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"有/无supervised contrastive loss对F1和embedding分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_supcon_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      without_supcon_macro_f1: 0.8924\n      delta_supcon_pp: 1.31\n      with_supcon_embed_separation: 0.847\n      without_supcon_embed_separation: 0.761\n      supcon_weight: 0.3\n      supcon_temperature: 0.07\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon在best档位下提供1.31pp的增益，效果显著但不是主要贡献者。\n      增益来自SupCon对GRU hidden states的正则化效应——它强制同类窗口的表示聚集、\n      异类分离，使最终分类边界更清晰。embedding分离度从0.761提升到0.847（+11.3%），\n      说明SupCon确实改善了表示空间结构。\n      增益相对温和是因为GRU本身已通过序列建模学到了较好的表示——\n      SupCon主要帮助处理边界case（stagnation onset附近的模糊窗口）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A4: SupCon Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Embed Separation\", \"Δ F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + CE + SupCon\", \"0.9055\", \"0.847\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"GRU + CE only\", \"0.8924\", \"0.761\", \"-1.31pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE对比：有/无SupCon的GRU hidden states，展示SupCon对类间分离的影响\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon是有价值的但非必要的组件。在paper中应放在appendix消融中，\n      不作为核心贡献——它是标准技术的应用，不构成novelty。\n      但1.31pp在stagnation检测场景中有实际意义（对应约40个窗口的正确判定差异）。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"仅用纯结构/数值特征（行数改动、文件数、命令类型计数等）分类，不使用NL embedding\"\n    expected_results:\n      non_nlp_macro_f1: 0.7234\n      non_nlp_accuracy: 0.7689\n      non_nlp_f1_stagnation: 0.6012\n      non_nlp_f1_progress: 0.8456\n      feature_count: 18\n      gap_vs_probe_pp: 18.21\n      gap_vs_meanpool_lr_pp: 4.49\n      top_features: [\"lines_changed_std\", \"unique_commands\", \"file_count_delta\", \"edit_entropy\"]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Non-NLP baseline仅用18个手工提取的结构特征（行数改动均值/方差、唯一命令数、文件数变化、\n      编辑熵等），不使用任何NL embedding。F1=0.7234，比probe低18.21pp。\n      这证明NL embedding的必要性——结构特征能捕获一些表面模式（如\"改动行数为零\"=stagnation），\n      但无法理解动作的语义内容（如\"执行了有意义的搜索\"vs\"执行了无效的重复搜索\"）。\n      Stagnation检测上尤其差（0.6012），因为很多语义停滞在结构上并不明显——\n      agent可能在修改文件（行数变化>0）但修改方向错误。\n      有趣的是non-NLP还是比random（0.4955）高很多，说明结构信号有一定的预测力，\n      但远不足以替代语义理解。这为EMNLP venue fit提供了强论据：\n      NL理解是进步检测的关键组件，将本工作锚定在NLP社区的核心能力上。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A5: NLP vs Non-NLP Features\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Features\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"NL Embeddings (1024d)\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"NL Embeddings (1024d)\", \"0.7683\", \"0.6571\"]\n          - [\"Non-NLP (GBT)\", \"Structural (18d)\", \"0.7234\", \"0.6012\"]\n          - [\"Random\", \"—\", \"0.4955\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance bar chart：non-NLP baseline中top-10特征的SHAP importance，展示结构特征的预测力上限\"\n    analysis: >\n      Non-NLP baseline的存在专门服务EMNLP venue fit策略——\n      证明\"理解agent行为的自然语言内容\"是progress检测的核心能力需求，\n      纯结构分析不足。这直接回应\"更适合ICSE/FSE\"的reviewer质疑。\n\n  - name: \"Data Scaling曲线\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100%训练数据→probe F1，评估标注数据需求曲线\"\n    expected_results:\n      pct10_macro_f1: 0.8234\n      pct25_macro_f1: 0.8612\n      pct50_macro_f1: 0.8876\n      pct100_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      pct10_train_size: 1540\n      pct25_train_size: 3850\n      pct50_train_size: 7700\n      pct100_train_size: 15401\n      saturation_point_pct: 60\n      marginal_gain_50_to_100_pp: 1.79\n    result_rationale: >\n      Scaling曲线呈典型的对数形状：10%数据（1,540窗口）已达0.8234 F1，\n      说明probe在少量标注数据下即可学到有效的progress信号。\n      从50%到100%仅增加1.79pp，接近饱和——这在best档位下是积极信号，\n      意味着弱监督框架即使只标注部分数据也能产生足够的训练信号。\n      饱和点约在60%（~9,240窗口），此后增益递减。\n      这为实践指导提供了价值：对新domain/agent，不需要跑完所有轨迹就能训练有效的probe。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A6: Data Scaling\"\n        columns: [\"Train %\", \"Train Size\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Δ vs 100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", \"1,540\", \"0.8234\", \"-8.21pp\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"3,850\", \"0.8612\", \"-4.43pp\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"7,700\", \"0.8876\", \"-1.79pp\"]\n          - [\"100%\", \"15,401\", \"0.9055\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scaling curve：x=训练数据量(log)，y=Macro-F1，标注饱和点和95%性能线\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scaling曲线的实际意义：证明弱监督框架的data efficiency——\n      即使在数据受限场景（如新agent/新domain），少量轨迹+LF即可训练有效probe。\n      这强化了方法论贡献的实用性叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Simulated Early Termination\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在held-out轨迹上模拟probe驱动的early stopping，计算token节省vs成功率tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_0_5:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 38.4\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 94.2\n        false_termination_rate: 0.058\n      threshold_0_7:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 27.1\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 97.8\n        false_termination_rate: 0.022\n      threshold_0_9:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 14.3\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 99.4\n        false_termination_rate: 0.006\n      optimal_threshold: 0.6\n      optimal_tokens_saved_pct: 32.7\n      optimal_success_preserved_pct: 96.1\n      intervention_paradox_evidence: true\n      paradox_detail: \"17.3%的被终止轨迹在原始run中最终resolved——但平均在解决前又消耗了2,847 tokens在无效动作上\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在best档位下，probe的高准确率（0.9055 F1）使得early termination策略切实可行。\n      Threshold=0.5时可节省38.4% tokens但牺牲5.8%的潜在成功（false termination），\n      threshold=0.7是保守选择（27.1%节省，仅2.2% false termination）。\n      Intervention Paradox确实存在：部分被标记为stagnation并建议终止的轨迹在原始run中\n      最终resolved——但分析发现这些\"迟来的成功\"付出了极高的token代价\n      （平均2,847额外tokens），cost-effectiveness角度早终止仍然有利。\n      这证明probe不仅是分类工具，更是实际可部署的agent效率优化组件。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Early Termination Tradeoffs\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold\", \"Tokens Saved\", \"Success Preserved\", \"False Termination\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.5\", \"38.4%\", \"94.2%\", \"5.8%\"]\n          - [\"0.6 (optimal)\", \"32.7%\", \"96.1%\", \"3.9%\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"27.1%\", \"97.8%\", \"2.2%\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"14.3%\", \"99.4%\", \"0.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: x=tokens saved (%)，y=success rate preserved (%)，各threshold标注，highlight Pareto-optimal region\"\n      - \"Intervention Paradox分析图：被终止轨迹中最终resolved的比例 vs 它们在resolve前的额外token消耗分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      Early termination simulation将probe从学术贡献提升到实用工具——\n      32.7%的token节省在大规模agent部署中意味着显著的成本降低。\n      Intervention Paradox的量化（17.3%被终止轨迹原本会成功，但代价是平均2,847额外tokens）\n      为threshold选择提供了principled依据，不仅仅是accuracy vs coverage的权衡，\n      而是cost-adjusted expected value的优化。\n\n  - name: \"可解释性可视化\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"GRU hidden states的t-SNE/UMAP可视化 + attention权重分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_cluster_separation: \"clear\"\n      progress_cluster_count: 2\n      stagnation_cluster_count: 3\n      attention_onset_concentration: 0.73\n      attention_pattern_stagnation: \"weight peaks at step 2-3 (onset)\"\n      attention_pattern_progress: \"roughly uniform across steps\"\n      silhouette_score: 0.412\n    result_rationale: >\n      在best档位下，GRU hidden states应形成清晰的progress/stagnation分离。\n      Progress形成2个子cluster（持续进展 vs 先探索后进展），\n      stagnation形成3个子cluster（重复型、漂移型、静止型）——\n      这与错误分析中的模式分类一致。\n      Attention权重在stagnation窗口中集中在step 2-3（onset位置），浓度系数0.73，\n      说明GRU+attention确实学会了关注\"转折点\"而非均匀处理所有步骤。\n      Progress窗口中attention更均匀，因为每一步都在贡献进展信号。\n      Silhouette score 0.412表明聚类结构存在但非完美分离——\n      这是预期的，因为progress/stagnation是连续谱，不是离散类别。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE 2D plot：GRU last-layer hidden states，颜色=标签（progress蓝/stagnation红），marker=conf level（大=conf3, 中=conf2），展示类别分离和置信度梯度\"\n      - \"UMAP 2D plot：同上但用UMAP投影，对比两种降维方法的稳定性\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap矩阵：随机采样20个stagnation和20个progress窗口的attention weights（5 steps × 1 head），标注onset step位置\"\n      - \"Attention weight分布box plot：stagnation vs progress窗口中各step位置的attention weight分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      可解释性分析为paper提供了定性证据支撑定量结论：\n      (1) t-SNE分离确认probe学到了有意义的progress/stagnation表示；\n      (2) stagnation的3个子cluster为future work（细粒度stagnation分类）提供了线索；\n      (3) attention对onset step的聚焦是最有说服力的发现——\n      它直接可视化了\"时序建模的增量价值\"，这是Mean-pooling无法实现的。\n\n  - name: \"人工标注Gold Set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400窗口3人标注gold set，Fleiss κ一致性，在人工标签上重新评估所有方法\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_annotated: 400\n      annotator_count: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.724\n      human_label_accuracy_vs_majority_vote_pct: 84.5\n      agreement_3_of_3_pct: 68.2\n      agreement_2_of_3_pct: 31.8\n      probe_f1_on_gold: 0.8623\n      repeat3_f1_on_gold: 0.7934\n      lf_oracle_f1_on_gold: 0.8187\n      llm_judge_f1_on_gold: 0.8412\n      meanpool_lr_f1_on_gold: 0.7289\n      probe_gap_vs_repeat3_on_gold_pp: 6.89\n      gold_stagnation_count: 156\n      gold_progress_count: 244\n      majority_vote_errors_on_gold: 62\n      mv_error_type_stagnation_as_progress: 38\n      mv_error_type_progress_as_stagnation: 24\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fleiss κ=0.724（substantial agreement）反映了progress/stagnation标注的内在难度——\n      部分窗口确实处于模糊地带（如agent在做有目的的探索但看起来没有进展）。\n      人工标签验证majority vote准确率84.5%（在best档[80,90]范围内），\n      说明弱监督标签整体可靠但有约15%的噪声——主要集中在conf=1窗口。\n      Probe在gold set上F1=0.8623，比在majority vote标签上的0.9055低4.32pp——\n      这个下降主要来自majority vote标签中被人类纠正的case（probe学了一些错误标签的模式）。\n      关键是probe在gold set上仍显著优于所有baseline：\n      +6.89pp vs Repeat-3, +4.36pp vs LF Oracle, +2.11pp vs LLM-as-judge。\n      这彻底破解circular evaluation顾虑：即使在真实标签上，probe的优势依然明确。\n      38个majority vote将stagnation误标为progress > 24个反方向错误，\n      说明弱监督框架对progress有轻微偏好——与数据中progress占比71.5%的先验一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Results on Human-Annotated Gold Set (400 windows)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"F1-Prog\", \"Δ vs Repeat-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.8623\", \"0.8089\", \"0.9157\", \"+6.89pp\"]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet 4 (few-shot)\", \"0.8412\", \"0.7834\", \"0.8990\", \"+4.78pp\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"0.8187\", \"0.7512\", \"0.8862\", \"+2.53pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.7934\", \"0.7198\", \"0.8670\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"0.7289\", \"0.6234\", \"0.8344\", \"-6.45pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table A7: Majority Vote Label Quality\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Fleiss κ\", \"0.724\"]\n          - [\"3/3 Agreement\", \"68.2%\"]\n          - [\"2/3 Agreement\", \"31.8%\"]\n          - [\"MV Accuracy vs Gold\", \"84.5%\"]\n          - [\"MV Errors (stag→prog)\", \"38/400\"]\n          - [\"MV Errors (prog→stag)\", \"24/400\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix：majority vote标签 vs human gold标签，展示弱监督的系统性偏差方向\"\n      - \"Bar chart：所有方法在gold set vs majority vote标签上的F1对比，展示circular evaluation bias的大小\"\n    analysis: >\n      人工标注是本paper最关键的validation实验。κ=0.724和84.5%标签准确率共同证明：\n      (1) 弱监督标签整体可靠，支撑Claim 1；\n      (2) Probe在真实标签上仍优于所有baseline，排除circular evaluation的alternative explanation；\n      (3) LLM-as-judge在gold set上接近probe（差2.11pp），但考虑31x成本差异，probe仍Pareto-dominant。\n      这个实验应该出现在main paper Table 2，不是appendix——它是对所有reviewer concerns的统一回应。\n\n  - name: \"LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"分析哪个LF在stagnation onset最先激活（leading vs lagging indicator）\"\n    expected_results:\n      leading_indicator: \"command_repetition\"\n      cmd_rep_avg_lead_steps: 1.8\n      file_diff_avg_lead_steps: 0.3\n      outcome_backprop_avg_lag_steps: -2.1\n      first_lf_to_fire_distribution:\n        command_repetition: 0.52\n        file_diff_delta: 0.31\n        outcome_backpropagation: 0.17\n      temporal_agreement_at_onset: 0.34\n      temporal_agreement_at_peak: 0.71\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition是最早的leading indicator（平均领先1.8步），因为行为重复通常是\n      stagnation的最早信号——agent开始重复尝试同样的方法。file_diff_delta几乎实时（领先0.3步），\n      因为文件变化停止与stagnation几乎同时发生。outcome_backpropagation是lagging indicator\n      （滞后2.1步），因为它依赖最终结果的回溯——只有在后续步骤确认失败后才激活。\n      在onset时刻LF一致率仅34%，到stagnation peak时升至71%——\n      这解释了为什么conf=1窗口噪声高：它们多处于onset阶段，LF还未达成共识。\n      这个发现对probe设计有启示：probe可能从command_repetition信号中获益最多，\n      因为它是最早可用的监督信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A8: LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Role\", \"Avg Lead/Lag (steps)\", \"First-to-fire %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"Leading\", \"+1.8\", \"52%\"]\n          - [\"file_diff_delta\", \"Coincident\", \"+0.3\", \"31%\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"Lagging\", \"-2.1\", \"17%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline diagram：典型stagnation episode中3个LF的激活时间线，展示leading/lagging关系\"\n      - \"Heatmap：LF pair-wise agreement随窗口内步骤位置的变化，展示onset时低一致→peak时高一致的动态\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF temporal dynamics为弱监督框架增添了分析深度：\n      不同LF捕获stagnation的不同阶段——从早期行为信号到中期输出信号到晚期结果信号。\n      这是Snorkel到sequential data迁移的非平凡洞见——在i.i.d.设置中LF没有时序性，\n      但在trajectory上LF本身表现出leading/lagging动态。\n      这个分析可以放在Analysis section中，强化方法论贡献的深度。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10561,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10561},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f4d3c48-dae2-4ad7-bc6c-79545c647f2e","uuid":"4361d14b-abc0-4a8a-8958-be3cf901120f"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":335486,"duration_api_ms":336669,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始framing完全成立。Headline: 弱监督框架成功迁移到agent trajectory领域，\n  GRU probe在全量噪声标签上学到了超越启发式规则的时序progress信号，\n  且跨实现可迁移。三条claims各有独立实验支撑，无需调整强度。\n  Paper结构：弱监督框架（方法论贡献）+ 时序建模实证（技术贡献）+ 跨agent泛化（泛化性贡献），\n  强调Snorkel到sequential trajectory的非平凡迁移 + 实用性（<5ms inference）。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"全量数据泛化训练\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-002\"\n    description: \"conf≥1全量54,809窗口训练GRU probe，与conf≥2子集训练对比，验证标签噪声容忍度\"\n    expected_results:\n      fulldata_macro_f1: 0.8742\n      fulldata_accuracy: 0.9031\n      fulldata_f1_stagnation: 0.8189\n      fulldata_f1_progress: 0.9295\n      fulldata_precision_macro: 0.8853\n      fulldata_recall_macro: 0.8648\n      conf2_macro_f1_reference: 0.9055\n      delta_vs_conf2_pp: -3.13\n      gap_vs_repeat3_fulldata_pp: 6.52\n      best_epoch: 5\n      total_epochs: 10\n      val_macro_f1_best: 0.8891\n    result_rationale: >\n      conf=1窗口占总量72%（39,408/54,809），这些窗口仅有单个LF投票，标签噪声率约25-30%。\n      在best档位下，GRU的时序建模能力足以从噪声标签中提取一致的progress信号——\n      因为多数conf=1窗口的噪声是随机的而非系统性的，GRU通过序列内一致性约束实现了隐式去噪。\n      F1从0.9055下降至0.8742（-3.13pp）是合理的：噪声增加但训练数据量增加3.6x提供了补偿。\n      关键是gap vs Repeat-3仍保持6.52pp，证明probe在噪声条件下仍显著优于最强启发式。\n      训练需要更多epoch（5 vs 3）才能收敛，因为模型需要更多迭代来拟合噪声分布。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Full-data vs High-confidence Training\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Train Size\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"F1-Prog\", \"Δ vs Repeat-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"conf≥2 (MVP)\", \"15,401\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"0.9518\", \"+6.24pp\"]\n          - [\"conf≥1 (full)\", \"54,809\", \"0.8742\", \"0.8189\", \"0.9295\", \"+6.52pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"—\", \"0.8190\", \"0.7512\", \"0.8868\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curves对比图：conf≥2在epoch 3即收敛，conf≥1在epoch 5收敛但最终validation loss更低，说明大数据量最终弥补了噪声劣势\"\n      - \"Per-confidence-level F1分解：conf=1/2/3测试窗口上的F1分别为0.83/0.91/0.96，展示模型在高置信窗口上表现更好但低置信窗口也可用\"\n    analysis: >\n      F1仅下降3.13pp证明核心假设成立：conf=1噪声标签不显著损害probe学习能力。\n      Stagnation类F1下降更大（-4.04pp vs progress类-2.23pp），因为stagnation窗口在conf=1中噪声更高\n      （单个LF投stagnation时更易出错），但仍保持>0.81的可用水平。\n      Gap vs Repeat-3在全量数据上反而略增（6.52 vs 6.24pp），因为Repeat-3在conf=1窗口上\n      表现更差——这些窗口包含更多语义多样的停滞模式，正是Repeat-3无法捕获的。\n\n  - name: \"LF Ensemble Oracle Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接用3个LF的实时输出做窗口级判定（majority vote），作为probe的上界参照\"\n    expected_results:\n      lf_oracle_macro_f1_conf2: 0.8612\n      lf_oracle_macro_f1_fulldata: 0.8203\n      lf_oracle_f1_stagnation_conf2: 0.7985\n      lf_oracle_f1_progress_conf2: 0.9239\n      lf_oracle_f1_stagnation_fulldata: 0.7341\n      lf_oracle_f1_progress_fulldata: 0.9065\n      gap_probe_vs_oracle_conf2_pp: 4.43\n      gap_probe_vs_oracle_fulldata_pp: 5.39\n      lf_oracle_coverage: 0.719\n      abstain_rate: 0.281\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle直接使用LF投票结果，在conf≥2数据上表现较好因为这些窗口本身就是LF高一致的子集。\n      但oracle有两个固有局限：(1) 它只能在有LF投票的窗口上做判定，覆盖率仅71.9%；\n      (2) 它无法捕获LF规则之外的信号——比如action语义漂移、上下文依赖的progress模式。\n      Probe在conf≥2上超oracle 4.43pp，在全量数据上超5.39pp，差距扩大因为conf=1窗口中\n      LF之间分歧大，oracle的majority vote退化为单LF判定。这证明GRU学到了超越LF启发式的信号。\n      stagnation类上差距更大（probe 0.8593 vs oracle 0.7985 = +6.08pp），\n      因为stagnation的语义多样性恰好是规则方法的盲区。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: Probe vs LF Oracle vs Baselines\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1 (conf≥2)\", \"Macro-F1 (full)\", \"Coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8742\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle (majority)\", \"0.8612\", \"0.8203\", \"71.9%\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.8432\", \"0.8190\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Cosine Similarity\", \"0.3129\", \"—\", \"100%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram：probe正确但oracle错误的样本 vs oracle正确但probe错误的样本，展示probe捕获了oracle遗漏的模式类型\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe vs LF oracle的差距（4.43-5.39pp）直接论证了Claim 1的核心：\n      probe不只是在学LF的规则，而是从LF提供的弱监督信号出发，通过时序建模学到了更丰富的表示。\n      Oracle在stagnation检测上尤其弱——LF设计时各自关注不同的stagnation信号\n      （file_diff_delta关注输出变化、command_repetition关注行为重复、outcome_backpropagation关注结果），\n      它们的简单投票无法捕获多维度信号的交互。GRU通过序列建模隐式实现了这种信号融合。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-Judge Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude Sonnet 4 + GPT-4o zero-shot/few-shot窗口级progress判定，对比probe的cost-accuracy tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.8347\n      claude_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.8681\n      gpt4o_zeroshot_macro_f1: 0.8192\n      gpt4o_fewshot_macro_f1: 0.8534\n      claude_fewshot_f1_stagnation: 0.8103\n      claude_fewshot_f1_progress: 0.9259\n      probe_macro_f1_reference: 0.9055\n      gap_probe_vs_best_llm_pp: 3.74\n      claude_avg_tokens_per_window: 4280\n      claude_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 12.84\n      probe_cost_per_1k_windows_usd: 0.41\n      llm_judge_cost_multiplier: 31.3\n      claude_latency_per_window_ms: 2850\n      probe_latency_per_window_ms: 4.7\n      latency_multiplier: 606\n      eval_sample_size: 500\n      inter_run_variance_claude: 0.018\n      inter_run_variance_probe: 0.003\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-as-judge在best档位下表现良好但不及probe，原因有三：\n      (1) Window-level判定需要理解5-step序列的整体progress趋势，LLM倾向逐step评估再聚合，\n      丢失stagnation onset的时序签名——与Mean-pooling的failure mode类似；\n      (2) Zero-shot时LLM缺少domain-specific的progress/stagnation calibration，\n      few-shot通过示例部分弥补（+3.34pp for Claude），但仍不如从15K样本中学习的probe；\n      (3) LLM在stagnation检测上特别保守——倾向将\"有动作执行\"判为progress，\n      即使这些动作集体无效。Claude优于GPT-4o因为对code/agent行为的理解更强。\n      Cost multiplier 31.3x来自：每窗口平均4,280 tokens（5 steps × 800+ tokens/step + prompt），\n      以Sonnet 4价格计算。Probe推理仅需前向传播1024×5维输入，成本几乎可忽略。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Probe vs LLM-as-Judge\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"Cost/1K\", \"Latency/window\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"$0.41\", \"4.7ms\"]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet 4 (few-shot)\", \"0.8681\", \"0.8103\", \"$12.84\", \"2.85s\"]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet 4 (zero-shot)\", \"0.8347\", \"0.7756\", \"$11.20\", \"2.41s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o (few-shot)\", \"0.8534\", \"0.7948\", \"$9.63\", \"3.12s\"]\n          - [\"GPT-4o (zero-shot)\", \"0.8192\", \"0.7589\", \"$8.47\", \"2.78s\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-Accuracy Pareto图：x轴=cost per 1K windows (log scale)，y轴=Macro-F1。Probe位于Pareto前沿左上角，LLM-as-judge位于右侧。标注cost multiplier和F1 gap\"\n      - \"Confusion matrix对比：Probe vs Claude few-shot，highlight probe在semantic stagnation上的优势\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-as-judge在F1上可用（0.87）但不及probe（0.91），且成本高31x、延迟高606x。\n      这直接回应reviewer的\"为什么不直接用LLM\"质疑：即使忽略成本，probe在准确率上也更优，\n      因为它从大量弱监督样本中学到了domain-calibrated的progress判定边界。\n      LLM的优势场景是冷启动（无训练数据时），但一旦有LF框架提供弱监督标签，\n      专用probe在accuracy和efficiency上双重胜出。这构成了清晰的cost-accuracy Pareto论证。\n\n  - name: \"Mean-pooling + Logistic Regression Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-meanpool-lr\"\n    description: \"窗口内step embeddings均值池化 + LR分类，作为非时序建模的参数匹配下界\"\n    expected_results:\n      meanpool_lr_macro_f1: 0.7683\n      meanpool_lr_accuracy: 0.8104\n      meanpool_lr_f1_stagnation: 0.6571\n      meanpool_lr_f1_progress: 0.8795\n      meanpool_lr_precision_macro: 0.7892\n      meanpool_lr_recall_macro: 0.7543\n      gap_gru_vs_meanpool_pp: 13.72\n      meanpool_lr_best_C: 0.1\n      meanpool_svm_macro_f1: 0.7821\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mean-pooling将5个step embeddings平均为单个1024维向量，完全丢弃了步骤间的时序信息。\n      在best档位下F1=0.7683，比GRU低13.72pp，差距显著。\n      根本原因：stagnation的核心时序特征是\"从有效到无效的转折点\"——\n      比如前2步有进展但后3步停滞，mean-pooling会将这种模式平均成\"中等进展\"，\n      而GRU通过门控机制精确定位transition point。\n      Stagnation类F1尤其低（0.6571 vs GRU的0.8593），因为stagnation窗口中\n      往往混有个别看似有效的step（如运行了新命令但结果无用），均值化后这些step\n      稀释了stagnation信号。Progress类相对好（0.8795）因为progress窗口中steps通常一致向前。\n      SVM略优于LR（+1.38pp）因为非线性核捕获了部分embedding空间中的非线性边界，\n      但仍远不如GRU，说明瓶颈在时序建模而非分类器容量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Temporal vs Static Aggregation\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Aggregation\", \"Classifier\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"Δ vs GRU\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"Sequential (learned)\", \"GRU+Attention\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"Mean\", \"Logistic Regression\", \"0.7683\", \"0.6571\", \"-13.72pp\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + SVM\", \"Mean\", \"RBF-SVM\", \"0.7821\", \"0.6743\", \"-12.34pp\"]\n          - [\"Max-pool + LR\", \"Max\", \"Logistic Regression\", \"0.7412\", \"0.6298\", \"-16.43pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"Rule-based\", \"Heuristic\", \"0.8432\", \"0.7512\", \"-6.24pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 各聚合策略的Macro-F1对比，清晰展示时序建模（GRU）相对于静态聚合（mean/max-pool）的增量价值\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mean-pool+LR的0.7683 F1确认了时序建模的必要性——GRU的+13.72pp增益不是来自更大的模型容量\n      （LR在1024维上已有充分表达力），而是来自序列内步骤间依赖关系的建模。\n      有趣的是Repeat-3（0.8432）反而优于Mean-pool+LR（0.7683），因为Repeat-3至少捕获了\n      一种时序模式（连续重复），而mean-pooling连这种简单模式也丢失了。\n      这为Claim 2提供了强支撑：时序建模是关键，不仅仅是更好的特征。\n\n  - name: \"Probe错误分析\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"在conf≥2测试集上对probe的FP/FN按action type、LF source、trajectory outcome分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_test_errors: 221\n      false_positives: 98\n      false_negatives: 123\n      fp_rate: 0.0412\n      fn_rate: 0.0636\n      fp_dominant_pattern: \"exploratory_actions_misclassified_as_stagnation\"\n      fn_dominant_pattern: \"semantic_drift_with_diverse_commands\"\n      fp_by_action_type:\n        file_editing: 0.31\n        command_execution: 0.42\n        search_exploration: 0.27\n      fn_by_action_type:\n        file_editing: 0.24\n        command_execution: 0.35\n        mixed_diverse: 0.41\n      fp_trajectory_outcome_resolved_pct: 0.67\n      fn_trajectory_outcome_unresolved_pct: 0.82\n      errors_where_repeat3_correct: 34\n      errors_where_probe_uniquely_correct: 187\n    result_rationale: >\n      在best档位下probe的错误总量较少（221/3,080 ≈ 7.2%），且错误分布揭示了有意义的模式。\n      FP（将progress误判为stagnation）集中在探索性行为——agent在搜索文件、阅读文档、\n      尝试不同方法时，表面上看起来\"没有进展\"但实际在积累信息。这是probe的合理failure mode：\n      information gathering确实与stagnation在embedding空间中相似（都表现为\"无输出变化\"）。\n      FN（将stagnation误判为progress）集中在语义漂移场景——agent执行多样化但集体无效的命令，\n      每一步看起来都不同，embedding变化大但方向无效。这正是probe最难的case，也是future work方向。\n      67%的FP发生在最终resolved的轨迹中——probe对\"暂时绕路但最终成功\"的轨迹过于悲观。\n      Probe相比Repeat-3额外捕获了187个正确case，仅在34个case上不如Repeat-3——净增值清晰。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Error Analysis by Pattern Type\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"Count\", \"Dominant Pattern\", \"Example\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP (progress→stagnation)\", \"98\", \"Exploratory search without file changes\", \"Agent reads 4 files, runs grep, no edits yet\"]\n          - [\"FN (stagnation→progress)\", \"123\", \"Diverse but ineffective commands\", \"Agent tries 5 different fix approaches, all fail\"]\n      - name: \"Table 8: Probe vs Repeat-3 Error Overlap\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"Count\", \"Pct of Total Errors\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Both wrong\", \"87\", \"39.4%\"]\n          - [\"Probe wrong, Repeat-3 correct\", \"34\", \"15.4%\"]\n          - [\"Probe correct, Repeat-3 wrong\", \"187\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Both correct\", \"2,772\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Error case gallery：4个代表性FP和4个代表性FN的窗口摘要，标注action sequence和LF votes，帮助reviewer理解probe的failure mode\"\n      - \"Scatter plot：x=窗口内embedding变化量，y=probe预测概率，颜色=真实标签，标注FP/FN cluster位置\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析服务于两个论文目标：(1) 展示probe捕获了Repeat-3遗漏的187个case——这些是\n      语义多样的停滞模式（如agent用不同方法反复失败但Repeat-3只检测字面重复）；\n      (2) 识别probe的系统性failure mode（exploratory behavior vs stagnation的区分），\n      为future work提供方向（引入trajectory outcome信号或多粒度建模）。\n      FP中67%在resolved轨迹中这一发现特别有价值——可以在Discussion中讨论\n      \"progress\"概念的粒度：window-level停滞不等于trajectory-level失败。\n\n  - name: \"跨Agent迁移评估\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent训练的probe在OpenHands轨迹上zero-shot评估，验证progress信号的跨实现迁移性\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_windows: 48352\n      openhands_stagnation_windows: 18914\n      openhands_progress_windows: 29438\n      cross_agent_macro_f1: 0.8347\n      cross_agent_accuracy: 0.8621\n      cross_agent_f1_stagnation: 0.7823\n      cross_agent_f1_progress: 0.8871\n      cross_agent_precision_macro: 0.8456\n      cross_agent_recall_macro: 0.8264\n      within_agent_reference_f1: 0.9055\n      delta_cross_vs_within_pp: -7.08\n      repeat3_on_openhands_f1: 0.7894\n      gap_vs_repeat3_cross_pp: 4.53\n      lf_adaptation_notes: \"command_repetition LF需适配OpenHands的action格式差异\"\n      openhands_embed_time_hours: 6.2\n      openhands_unique_instances: 2195\n    result_rationale: >\n      跨agent迁移F1=0.8347，比within-agent低7.08pp但仍在best档可用范围[0.78, 0.88]内。\n      下降来自三个因素：(1) OpenHands的action格式与SWE-agent不同——OpenHands使用\n      structured action space（CmdRunAction, FileEditAction等），而SWE-agent使用\n      free-form bash commands，embedding空间有分布偏移；(2) OpenHands的停滞模式不同——\n      它有专门的think action和structured editing，某些SWE-agent中的\"无效重复\"在OpenHands中\n      不存在，但OpenHands有自己独特的停滞模式（如反复调用FileEditAction但diff为空）；\n      (3) LF适配引入了少量noise——command_repetition LF需要重写以匹配OpenHands格式。\n      尽管如此，0.8347仍显著优于Repeat-3在OpenHands上的表现（0.7894, +4.53pp），\n      证明probe学到的不是SWE-agent特有的行为模式，而是更通用的progress信号——\n      embedding空间中的\"步骤间语义变化模式\"在不同agent实现间部分共享。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Cross-Agent Transfer Results\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Agent\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"F1-Prog\", \"Δ vs Repeat-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Within-agent\", \"SWE-agent\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"0.9518\", \"+6.24pp\"]\n          - [\"Cross-agent (zero-shot)\", \"OpenHands\", \"0.8347\", \"0.7823\", \"0.8871\", \"+4.53pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"OpenHands\", \"0.7894\", \"0.7156\", \"0.8632\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"OpenHands\", \"0.7981\", \"0.7234\", \"0.8728\", \"+0.87pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE可视化：SWE-agent和OpenHands的GRU hidden states在同一空间中的分布，颜色标注agent来源和progress/stagnation标签，展示跨agent的表示空间重叠程度\"\n      - \"Per-instance difficulty scatter：x=SWE-bench instance difficulty (resolved rate)，y=cross-agent probe F1，验证迁移效果是否与任务难度相关\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨agent迁移的成功直接支撑Claim 3：probe学到的是通用的goal-directed progress信号。\n      7.08pp的下降主要来自distribution shift而非信号本质差异——t-SNE可视化会展示\n      两个agent的hidden states在progress/stagnation维度上有清晰重叠，但在agent-specific\n      行为模式维度上有偏移。Gap vs Repeat-3从6.24pp降至4.53pp但仍显著，\n      说明时序建模的增量价值在跨agent场景下依然存在。\n      LF Oracle在OpenHands上仅比Repeat-3好0.87pp，因为LF规则是为SWE-agent设计的，\n      适配后覆盖率和精度都下降——而probe通过embedding空间的泛化能力部分弥补了这个gap。\n\n  - name: \"Window Size消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"k=3,5,7的窗口大小消融，评估检测粒度与信号积累的tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_macro_f1: 0.8724\n      k5_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      k7_macro_f1: 0.9148\n      k3_f1_stagnation: 0.8142\n      k5_f1_stagnation: 0.8593\n      k7_f1_stagnation: 0.8712\n      k3_detection_latency_steps: 3\n      k5_detection_latency_steps: 5\n      k7_detection_latency_steps: 7\n      k3_total_windows: 72841\n      k5_total_windows: 54809\n      k7_total_windows: 43267\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=7比k=5略优（+0.93pp），因为更长的窗口积累了更多时序context——\n      特别是stagnation onset通常需要3-4步来确认（前几步可能是合理的探索），\n      k=7提供了足够的上下文来区分\"暂时探索\"和\"真正停滞\"。\n      k=3较差（-3.31pp），因为3步窗口中有效信号太少——很多stagnation在3步内\n      看起来与exploration无异。但k=3的优势是检测延迟最低（3步 vs 7步），\n      在实际部署中有latency-accuracy tradeoff。\n      k=5是sweet spot：F1接近k=7但检测延迟少2步，且与LF设计一致（LF也基于5步窗口设计），\n      减少了LF-probe之间的粒度不匹配。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A1: Window Size Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Window k\", \"# Windows\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"Detection Latency\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"k=3\", \"72,841\", \"0.8724\", \"0.8142\", \"3 steps\"]\n          - [\"k=5 (default)\", \"54,809\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"5 steps\"]\n          - [\"k=7\", \"43,267\", \"0.9148\", \"0.8712\", \"7 steps\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line chart: window size vs F1 和 detection latency 的dual-axis图，展示accuracy-latency tradeoff曲线\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=5的选择是合理的——k=7仅增加0.93pp但延迟增加2步、数据量减少21%。\n      在paper中可以用k=7结果作为\"oracle window size\"参考，说明更多context确实有帮助，\n      但k=5在实用性和准确率之间取得了最佳平衡。\n\n  - name: \"架构消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU+attention vs GRU+mean-pool vs Transformer encoder vs MLP on pooled\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_attention_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      gru_meanpool_macro_f1: 0.8891\n      transformer_encoder_macro_f1: 0.8967\n      mlp_pooled_macro_f1: 0.7812\n      gru_attention_params: 1.32e6\n      gru_meanpool_params: 1.31e6\n      transformer_encoder_params: 2.67e6\n      mlp_pooled_params: 0.53e6\n      gru_attention_train_time_min: 12\n      transformer_encoder_train_time_min: 28\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU+attention最优但Transformer encoder仅差0.88pp——在best档位下两种时序架构都有效，\n      差距不大。GRU+attention的优势来自attention机制对stagnation onset位置的显式建模——\n      attention权重可以聚焦在序列中\"转折\"的step上，而GRU+mean-pool丢失了这种位置敏感性。\n      Transformer encoder参数量2x于GRU但F1略低，因为5步的序列太短，\n      self-attention的全局依赖建模优势无法体现，反而过参数化导致轻微过拟合。\n      MLP on pooled（0.7812）与Mean-pool+LR（0.7683）接近，确认了瓶颈在时序建模而非分类器。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A2: Architecture Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"Params\", \"Train Time\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + Attention\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\", \"1.32M\", \"12 min\"]\n          - [\"Transformer Encoder (2L)\", \"0.8967\", \"0.8478\", \"2.67M\", \"28 min\"]\n          - [\"GRU + Mean-pool\", \"0.8891\", \"0.8389\", \"1.31M\", \"11 min\"]\n          - [\"MLP on Concat\", \"0.7812\", \"0.6689\", \"0.53M\", \"5 min\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Attention weight heatmap：在stagnation窗口中attention集中在onset step（通常step 2-3），在progress窗口中attention分布更均匀\"\n    analysis: >\n      架构消融的核心结论：时序建模是关键（GRU/Transformer >> MLP/pooling），\n      但具体架构选择影响不大（GRU vs Transformer差异<1pp）。\n      这支持paper的framing——架构是deliberate simple choice，贡献在方法论而非架构创新。\n      Attention的可解释性是bonus：它自然揭示了stagnation onset的位置。\n\n  - name: \"LF Hold-one-out消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个LF重新训练probe，量化各LF的边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_3lf_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      drop_file_diff_delta_f1: 0.8634\n      drop_command_repetition_f1: 0.8812\n      drop_outcome_backprop_f1: 0.8903\n      marginal_file_diff_delta_pp: 4.21\n      marginal_command_repetition_pp: 2.43\n      marginal_outcome_backprop_pp: 1.52\n      two_lf_coverage_drop_pct:\n        without_file_diff: 0.583\n        without_cmd_rep: 0.641\n        without_outcome: 0.695\n    result_rationale: >\n      file_diff_delta贡献最大（-4.21pp when removed），因为它是唯一直接测量\"输出变化\"的LF——\n      在agent trajectory中，文件变化是最强的progress信号，移除它导致大量progress窗口失去关键标注依据。\n      command_repetition贡献中等（-2.43pp），它捕获的是stagnation中最常见的子模式（行为重复），\n      但部分信号与Repeat-3 baseline重叠。\n      outcome_backpropagation贡献最小（-1.52pp），因为它是事后信号（基于最终结果回溯），\n      在训练时提供的增量信息最少——很多窗口在它投票前已被其他两个LF覆盖。\n      但三个LF的组合效应是非加和的：移除任一个都导致覆盖率下降（从71.9%降至58-70%），\n      这意味着每个LF覆盖了不同子集的窗口，它们的互补性是框架价值的核心。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A3: LF Hold-one-out Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"LF Configuration\", \"# LFs\", \"Coverage\", \"Probe F1\", \"Δ vs Full\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"All 3 LFs\", \"3\", \"71.9%\", \"0.9055\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"− file_diff_delta\", \"2\", \"58.3%\", \"0.8634\", \"-4.21pp\"]\n          - [\"− command_repetition\", \"2\", \"64.1%\", \"0.8812\", \"-2.43pp\"]\n          - [\"− outcome_backprop\", \"2\", \"69.5%\", \"0.8903\", \"-1.52pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar chart：每个LF在不同conf级别上的投票覆盖率，展示LF间的互补性\"\n    analysis: >\n      三个LF都有不可替代的贡献，但重要性递减（file_diff > cmd_rep > outcome_backprop）。\n      这个结果for paper的意义：(1) 证明LF框架设计是合理的——每个LF捕获了不同维度的信号；\n      (2) 提示未来工作可以设计更多LF来进一步提升覆盖率和准确率；\n      (3) file_diff_delta的主导地位与直觉一致——在SWE任务中，代码变化是最直接的progress指标。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon辅助损失消融\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"有/无supervised contrastive loss对F1和embedding分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_supcon_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      without_supcon_macro_f1: 0.8924\n      delta_supcon_pp: 1.31\n      with_supcon_embed_separation: 0.847\n      without_supcon_embed_separation: 0.761\n      supcon_weight: 0.3\n      supcon_temperature: 0.07\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon在best档位下提供1.31pp的增益，效果显著但不是主要贡献者。\n      增益来自SupCon对GRU hidden states的正则化效应——它强制同类窗口的表示聚集、\n      异类分离，使最终分类边界更清晰。embedding分离度从0.761提升到0.847（+11.3%），\n      说明SupCon确实改善了表示空间结构。\n      增益相对温和是因为GRU本身已通过序列建模学到了较好的表示——\n      SupCon主要帮助处理边界case（stagnation onset附近的模糊窗口）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A4: SupCon Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Embed Separation\", \"Δ F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU + CE + SupCon\", \"0.9055\", \"0.847\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"GRU + CE only\", \"0.8924\", \"0.761\", \"-1.31pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE对比：有/无SupCon的GRU hidden states，展示SupCon对类间分离的影响\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon是有价值的但非必要的组件。在paper中应放在appendix消融中，\n      不作为核心贡献——它是标准技术的应用，不构成novelty。\n      但1.31pp在stagnation检测场景中有实际意义（对应约40个窗口的正确判定差异）。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"仅用纯结构/数值特征（行数改动、文件数、命令类型计数等）分类，不使用NL embedding\"\n    expected_results:\n      non_nlp_macro_f1: 0.7234\n      non_nlp_accuracy: 0.7689\n      non_nlp_f1_stagnation: 0.6012\n      non_nlp_f1_progress: 0.8456\n      feature_count: 18\n      gap_vs_probe_pp: 18.21\n      gap_vs_meanpool_lr_pp: 4.49\n      top_features: [\"lines_changed_std\", \"unique_commands\", \"file_count_delta\", \"edit_entropy\"]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Non-NLP baseline仅用18个手工提取的结构特征（行数改动均值/方差、唯一命令数、文件数变化、\n      编辑熵等），不使用任何NL embedding。F1=0.7234，比probe低18.21pp。\n      这证明NL embedding的必要性——结构特征能捕获一些表面模式（如\"改动行数为零\"=stagnation），\n      但无法理解动作的语义内容（如\"执行了有意义的搜索\"vs\"执行了无效的重复搜索\"）。\n      Stagnation检测上尤其差（0.6012），因为很多语义停滞在结构上并不明显——\n      agent可能在修改文件（行数变化>0）但修改方向错误。\n      有趣的是non-NLP还是比random（0.4955）高很多，说明结构信号有一定的预测力，\n      但远不足以替代语义理解。这为EMNLP venue fit提供了强论据：\n      NL理解是进步检测的关键组件，将本工作锚定在NLP社区的核心能力上。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A5: NLP vs Non-NLP Features\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Features\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"NL Embeddings (1024d)\", \"0.9055\", \"0.8593\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"NL Embeddings (1024d)\", \"0.7683\", \"0.6571\"]\n          - [\"Non-NLP (GBT)\", \"Structural (18d)\", \"0.7234\", \"0.6012\"]\n          - [\"Random\", \"—\", \"0.4955\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance bar chart：non-NLP baseline中top-10特征的SHAP importance，展示结构特征的预测力上限\"\n    analysis: >\n      Non-NLP baseline的存在专门服务EMNLP venue fit策略——\n      证明\"理解agent行为的自然语言内容\"是progress检测的核心能力需求，\n      纯结构分析不足。这直接回应\"更适合ICSE/FSE\"的reviewer质疑。\n\n  - name: \"Data Scaling曲线\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100%训练数据→probe F1，评估标注数据需求曲线\"\n    expected_results:\n      pct10_macro_f1: 0.8234\n      pct25_macro_f1: 0.8612\n      pct50_macro_f1: 0.8876\n      pct100_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      pct10_train_size: 1540\n      pct25_train_size: 3850\n      pct50_train_size: 7700\n      pct100_train_size: 15401\n      saturation_point_pct: 60\n      marginal_gain_50_to_100_pp: 1.79\n    result_rationale: >\n      Scaling曲线呈典型的对数形状：10%数据（1,540窗口）已达0.8234 F1，\n      说明probe在少量标注数据下即可学到有效的progress信号。\n      从50%到100%仅增加1.79pp，接近饱和——这在best档位下是积极信号，\n      意味着弱监督框架即使只标注部分数据也能产生足够的训练信号。\n      饱和点约在60%（~9,240窗口），此后增益递减。\n      这为实践指导提供了价值：对新domain/agent，不需要跑完所有轨迹就能训练有效的probe。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A6: Data Scaling\"\n        columns: [\"Train %\", \"Train Size\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Δ vs 100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", \"1,540\", \"0.8234\", \"-8.21pp\"]\n          - [\"25%\", \"3,850\", \"0.8612\", \"-4.43pp\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"7,700\", \"0.8876\", \"-1.79pp\"]\n          - [\"100%\", \"15,401\", \"0.9055\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scaling curve：x=训练数据量(log)，y=Macro-F1，标注饱和点和95%性能线\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scaling曲线的实际意义：证明弱监督框架的data efficiency——\n      即使在数据受限场景（如新agent/新domain），少量轨迹+LF即可训练有效probe。\n      这强化了方法论贡献的实用性叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Simulated Early Termination\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在held-out轨迹上模拟probe驱动的early stopping，计算token节省vs成功率tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_0_5:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 38.4\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 94.2\n        false_termination_rate: 0.058\n      threshold_0_7:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 27.1\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 97.8\n        false_termination_rate: 0.022\n      threshold_0_9:\n        tokens_saved_pct: 14.3\n        success_rate_preserved_pct: 99.4\n        false_termination_rate: 0.006\n      optimal_threshold: 0.6\n      optimal_tokens_saved_pct: 32.7\n      optimal_success_preserved_pct: 96.1\n      intervention_paradox_evidence: true\n      paradox_detail: \"17.3%的被终止轨迹在原始run中最终resolved——但平均在解决前又消耗了2,847 tokens在无效动作上\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      在best档位下，probe的高准确率（0.9055 F1）使得early termination策略切实可行。\n      Threshold=0.5时可节省38.4% tokens但牺牲5.8%的潜在成功（false termination），\n      threshold=0.7是保守选择（27.1%节省，仅2.2% false termination）。\n      Intervention Paradox确实存在：部分被标记为stagnation并建议终止的轨迹在原始run中\n      最终resolved——但分析发现这些\"迟来的成功\"付出了极高的token代价\n      （平均2,847额外tokens），cost-effectiveness角度早终止仍然有利。\n      这证明probe不仅是分类工具，更是实际可部署的agent效率优化组件。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Early Termination Tradeoffs\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold\", \"Tokens Saved\", \"Success Preserved\", \"False Termination\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.5\", \"38.4%\", \"94.2%\", \"5.8%\"]\n          - [\"0.6 (optimal)\", \"32.7%\", \"96.1%\", \"3.9%\"]\n          - [\"0.7\", \"27.1%\", \"97.8%\", \"2.2%\"]\n          - [\"0.9\", \"14.3%\", \"99.4%\", \"0.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: x=tokens saved (%)，y=success rate preserved (%)，各threshold标注，highlight Pareto-optimal region\"\n      - \"Intervention Paradox分析图：被终止轨迹中最终resolved的比例 vs 它们在resolve前的额外token消耗分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      Early termination simulation将probe从学术贡献提升到实用工具——\n      32.7%的token节省在大规模agent部署中意味着显著的成本降低。\n      Intervention Paradox的量化（17.3%被终止轨迹原本会成功，但代价是平均2,847额外tokens）\n      为threshold选择提供了principled依据，不仅仅是accuracy vs coverage的权衡，\n      而是cost-adjusted expected value的优化。\n\n  - name: \"可解释性可视化\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"GRU hidden states的t-SNE/UMAP可视化 + attention权重分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_cluster_separation: \"clear\"\n      progress_cluster_count: 2\n      stagnation_cluster_count: 3\n      attention_onset_concentration: 0.73\n      attention_pattern_stagnation: \"weight peaks at step 2-3 (onset)\"\n      attention_pattern_progress: \"roughly uniform across steps\"\n      silhouette_score: 0.412\n    result_rationale: >\n      在best档位下，GRU hidden states应形成清晰的progress/stagnation分离。\n      Progress形成2个子cluster（持续进展 vs 先探索后进展），\n      stagnation形成3个子cluster（重复型、漂移型、静止型）——\n      这与错误分析中的模式分类一致。\n      Attention权重在stagnation窗口中集中在step 2-3（onset位置），浓度系数0.73，\n      说明GRU+attention确实学会了关注\"转折点\"而非均匀处理所有步骤。\n      Progress窗口中attention更均匀，因为每一步都在贡献进展信号。\n      Silhouette score 0.412表明聚类结构存在但非完美分离——\n      这是预期的，因为progress/stagnation是连续谱，不是离散类别。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE 2D plot：GRU last-layer hidden states，颜色=标签（progress蓝/stagnation红），marker=conf level（大=conf3, 中=conf2），展示类别分离和置信度梯度\"\n      - \"UMAP 2D plot：同上但用UMAP投影，对比两种降维方法的稳定性\"\n      - \"Attention heatmap矩阵：随机采样20个stagnation和20个progress窗口的attention weights（5 steps × 1 head），标注onset step位置\"\n      - \"Attention weight分布box plot：stagnation vs progress窗口中各step位置的attention weight分布\"\n    analysis: >\n      可解释性分析为paper提供了定性证据支撑定量结论：\n      (1) t-SNE分离确认probe学到了有意义的progress/stagnation表示；\n      (2) stagnation的3个子cluster为future work（细粒度stagnation分类）提供了线索；\n      (3) attention对onset step的聚焦是最有说服力的发现——\n      它直接可视化了\"时序建模的增量价值\"，这是Mean-pooling无法实现的。\n\n  - name: \"人工标注Gold Set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400窗口3人标注gold set，Fleiss κ一致性，在人工标签上重新评估所有方法\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_annotated: 400\n      annotator_count: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.724\n      human_label_accuracy_vs_majority_vote_pct: 84.5\n      agreement_3_of_3_pct: 68.2\n      agreement_2_of_3_pct: 31.8\n      probe_f1_on_gold: 0.8623\n      repeat3_f1_on_gold: 0.7934\n      lf_oracle_f1_on_gold: 0.8187\n      llm_judge_f1_on_gold: 0.8412\n      meanpool_lr_f1_on_gold: 0.7289\n      probe_gap_vs_repeat3_on_gold_pp: 6.89\n      gold_stagnation_count: 156\n      gold_progress_count: 244\n      majority_vote_errors_on_gold: 62\n      mv_error_type_stagnation_as_progress: 38\n      mv_error_type_progress_as_stagnation: 24\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fleiss κ=0.724（substantial agreement）反映了progress/stagnation标注的内在难度——\n      部分窗口确实处于模糊地带（如agent在做有目的的探索但看起来没有进展）。\n      人工标签验证majority vote准确率84.5%（在best档[80,90]范围内），\n      说明弱监督标签整体可靠但有约15%的噪声——主要集中在conf=1窗口。\n      Probe在gold set上F1=0.8623，比在majority vote标签上的0.9055低4.32pp——\n      这个下降主要来自majority vote标签中被人类纠正的case（probe学了一些错误标签的模式）。\n      关键是probe在gold set上仍显著优于所有baseline：\n      +6.89pp vs Repeat-3, +4.36pp vs LF Oracle, +2.11pp vs LLM-as-judge。\n      这彻底破解circular evaluation顾虑：即使在真实标签上，probe的优势依然明确。\n      38个majority vote将stagnation误标为progress > 24个反方向错误，\n      说明弱监督框架对progress有轻微偏好——与数据中progress占比71.5%的先验一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Results on Human-Annotated Gold Set (400 windows)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Macro-F1\", \"F1-Stag\", \"F1-Prog\", \"Δ vs Repeat-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GRU Probe\", \"0.8623\", \"0.8089\", \"0.9157\", \"+6.89pp\"]\n          - [\"Claude Sonnet 4 (few-shot)\", \"0.8412\", \"0.7834\", \"0.8990\", \"+4.78pp\"]\n          - [\"LF Oracle\", \"0.8187\", \"0.7512\", \"0.8862\", \"+2.53pp\"]\n          - [\"Repeat-3\", \"0.7934\", \"0.7198\", \"0.8670\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Mean-pool + LR\", \"0.7289\", \"0.6234\", \"0.8344\", \"-6.45pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table A7: Majority Vote Label Quality\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Fleiss κ\", \"0.724\"]\n          - [\"3/3 Agreement\", \"68.2%\"]\n          - [\"2/3 Agreement\", \"31.8%\"]\n          - [\"MV Accuracy vs Gold\", \"84.5%\"]\n          - [\"MV Errors (stag→prog)\", \"38/400\"]\n          - [\"MV Errors (prog→stag)\", \"24/400\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix：majority vote标签 vs human gold标签，展示弱监督的系统性偏差方向\"\n      - \"Bar chart：所有方法在gold set vs majority vote标签上的F1对比，展示circular evaluation bias的大小\"\n    analysis: >\n      人工标注是本paper最关键的validation实验。κ=0.724和84.5%标签准确率共同证明：\n      (1) 弱监督标签整体可靠，支撑Claim 1；\n      (2) Probe在真实标签上仍优于所有baseline，排除circular evaluation的alternative explanation；\n      (3) LLM-as-judge在gold set上接近probe（差2.11pp），但考虑31x成本差异，probe仍Pareto-dominant。\n      这个实验应该出现在main paper Table 2，不是appendix——它是对所有reviewer concerns的统一回应。\n\n  - name: \"LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"分析哪个LF在stagnation onset最先激活（leading vs lagging indicator）\"\n    expected_results:\n      leading_indicator: \"command_repetition\"\n      cmd_rep_avg_lead_steps: 1.8\n      file_diff_avg_lead_steps: 0.3\n      outcome_backprop_avg_lag_steps: -2.1\n      first_lf_to_fire_distribution:\n        command_repetition: 0.52\n        file_diff_delta: 0.31\n        outcome_backpropagation: 0.17\n      temporal_agreement_at_onset: 0.34\n      temporal_agreement_at_peak: 0.71\n    result_rationale: >\n      command_repetition是最早的leading indicator（平均领先1.8步），因为行为重复通常是\n      stagnation的最早信号——agent开始重复尝试同样的方法。file_diff_delta几乎实时（领先0.3步），\n      因为文件变化停止与stagnation几乎同时发生。outcome_backpropagation是lagging indicator\n      （滞后2.1步），因为它依赖最终结果的回溯——只有在后续步骤确认失败后才激活。\n      在onset时刻LF一致率仅34%，到stagnation peak时升至71%——\n      这解释了为什么conf=1窗口噪声高：它们多处于onset阶段，LF还未达成共识。\n      这个发现对probe设计有启示：probe可能从command_repetition信号中获益最多，\n      因为它是最早可用的监督信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A8: LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n        columns: [\"LF\", \"Role\", \"Avg Lead/Lag (steps)\", \"First-to-fire %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"command_repetition\", \"Leading\", \"+1.8\", \"52%\"]\n          - [\"file_diff_delta\", \"Coincident\", \"+0.3\", \"31%\"]\n          - [\"outcome_backpropagation\", \"Lagging\", \"-2.1\", \"17%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline diagram：典型stagnation episode中3个LF的激活时间线，展示leading/lagging关系\"\n      - \"Heatmap：LF pair-wise agreement随窗口内步骤位置的变化，展示onset时低一致→peak时高一致的动态\"\n    analysis: >\n      LF temporal dynamics为弱监督框架增添了分析深度：\n      不同LF捕获stagnation的不同阶段——从早期行为信号到中期输出信号到晚期结果信号。\n      这是Snorkel到sequential data迁移的非平凡洞见——在i.i.d.设置中LF没有时序性，\n      但在trajectory上LF本身表现出leading/lagging动态。\n      这个分析可以放在Analysis section中，强化方法论贡献的深度。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7f4d3c48-dae2-4ad7-bc6c-79545c647f2e","total_cost_usd":0.49614075,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10561,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":16743,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10561,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":16743,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10561,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10561},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5529,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005